        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: the subject of A Soldier and a Maker, the author of Ein Tagebuch, Jakob von Gunten\n- Works: A Soldier and a Maker, Ein Tagebuch\n- Roles: poet, composer, author\n\nFacts:\n- The musical A Soldier and a Maker depicts the life story of a subject who was both a poet and a composer.\n- The author of Ein Tagebuch was both a poet and a composer.\n- Jakob von Gunten is identified as the author of Ein Tagebuch.\n- The subject of A Soldier and a Maker and Jakob von Gunten were similar because each was both a poet and a composer.",
