        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ivor Gurney, Robert Walser, Iain Burnside\n- Works: A Soldier and a Maker, Ein Tagebuch, Jakob von Gunten\n- Topics: musical theatre, poetry, composition, literature\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Walser was a German-speaking Swiss writer who lived from 15 April 1878 to 25 December 1956.\n- Ivor Gurney was an English poet and composer, especially known for songs, who lived from 28 August 1890 to 26 December 1937.\n- Ein Tagebuch is a novel by Swiss writer Robert Walser that was first published in German in 1909.\n- A Soldier and a Maker is a piece of musical theatre by Iain Burnside about the life story of First World War poet and composer Ivor Gurney.",
